# Native signing and store credentials, anywhere in the repository. These are
# secrets: EAS keeps Atwe's Apple credentials on its own servers, and the Play
# upload key (atwe-mobile/eas.json points at ./play-service-account.json) must
# never be committed. None of these is tracked today; this keeps it that way.
play-service-account.json
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
